	"title"		"Anthony Algorithm - Relics (东尼算法 - 遗物)"
	"description"		"[h1]东尼算法 - 遗物 / Anthony Algorithm - Relics[/h1]

每局游戏,用东尼算法从本局种子确定性地生成 60 件遗物,并替换本局全部的遗物掉落.
与原版东尼算法相同的核心机制:[b]触发与效果是独立片段,生成时随机重组[/b] ——
任何合法的触发条件都可能挂上任何合法的效果,包括原版从未存在过的组合.
[i]Every run, deterministically generate 60 relics from the run seed and replace all relic drops. Triggers and effects are independent fragments recombined at generation time - the Anthony algorithm applied to relics.[/i]

[hr]

[h2]它做什么 / What it does[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]60 件生成遗物[/b] - 每局从种子派生,逐槽位重新生成(20 普通 / 21 罕见 / 19 稀有附近分布)
[*][b]条件重组[/b] - 触发片段(回合开始 / 回合结束 / 战斗开始 / 战斗结束 / 战斗胜利 / 进入战斗 / 拾取时 / 打出能力牌 / 敌人死亡 / 获得金币 / 格挡被清空)与效果片段(力量 / 活力 / 荆棘 / 全体易伤 / 格挡 / 回复 / 能量 / 抽牌 / 生命上限 / 金币 / 药水栏位 / 全体伤害)从[b]同一个池子独立采样[/b]
[*][b]双效果遗物[/b] - 约 30% 的遗物携带两个效果,同挂一个触发
[*][b]纯被动遗物[/b] - 少数遗物是首回合抽牌修正(正负都有)
[*][b]中英双语描述[/b] - 每件遗物的名字与描述由片段语义实时渲染
[*][b]确定性[/b] - 同种子 = 同一批遗物(逐字节一致);定义不读任何设置项,读档/重连恢复同一批
[*][b]负面词条池[/b] - 全游戏遗物(含不参与再生成的先古/事件遗物)的负面词条入池: 诅咒,失去生命上限,失去金币,自伤;均匀抽取,无概率加成.带拾取效果的遗物不可交易,与引擎规则一致
[*][b]先古限制词条[/b] - 先古遗物的限制类负面也入池(禁金币/禁药水/每回合出牌上限/卡牌效果不抽牌/能力牌费+1/敌人入场获得力量),且必定与引擎原本配对的增益同体出现(例如“禁金币”配“+1 能量”),不会生成只有代价没有收益的遗物
[*][b]纯增益词条[/b] - 先古遗物的纯增益(如 +1 能量)出现率限制在 5%
[/list]

[h2]负面词条 / Downside fragments[/h2]

[i]Downside fragments harvested from every relic in the game - including Ancient and Event relics whose cards never regenerate - join the pool: curses, Max-HP loss, gold loss, self-damage. They draw uniformly, with no appearance bonus. Relics with pickup effects are non-tradable, matching engine rules.[/i]

[h2]先古限制词条 / Ancient restriction fragments[/h2]

[i]The Ancient relics' restriction-type downsides also enter the pool - no gold, no potions, a per-turn card-play cap, card effects stop drawing, Power cards cost 1 more, enemies gain Strength on entry. Each one is forced to appear together with the benefit the engine pairs it with (for example the no-gold restriction ships with +1 Energy), so generation never yields a relic that costs something and grants nothing. Pure Ancient benefits (such as +1 Energy) are gated to a 5% appearance rate.[/i]

[h2]数据忠实度 / Data fidelity[/h2]

原子池从游戏[b]自身的 300 个遗物类[/b]提取,并经过[b]逐条人工审计账本[/b]过滤:
只有证据完整、六项对账(何时/谁/目标/数值/条件/状态)全部通过的片段进入生成池;
提取器无法核实或提取错误的条目(阈值当数值 / 正负号丢失 / 条件反转等)一律[b]拒绝[/b].
已知修复示例:水银玉猫袋(全体 1 易伤)、大蘑菇(首回合少抽 2 张,负号保留)、
弯刀(力量 1)、药水腰带(2 个栏位).
[i]Atoms are extracted from the game's own 300 relic classes and gated by a hand-audited deny-by-default ledger; unverifiable extractions never reach the pool.[/i]

[h2]遗物替换范围 / Relic replacement[/h2]

以下全部遗物来源只出生成遗物:
[list]
[*]战斗奖励 / 精英奖励 / 宝箱 / 商店 / 事件的随机遗物 / 挖掘 / 营火等
[/list]

保持原版不受影响的:
[list]
[*][b]先古之民(Ancient)遗物[/b] - 完全不动
[*]初始遗物 / Neow 遗物 / 事件专属固定遗物(本就不经过奖励池)
[/list]

[h2]游戏内设置 / In-game settings[/h2]

设置 -> 模组设置(专属设置页):
[list]
[*][b]Enabled(总开关)[/b] - 关闭后生成遗物停用,奖励池恢复原版
[*][b]ReplaceVanillaRelics(替换原版遗物)[/b] - 关闭后生成遗物与原版遗物混合掉落
[*]其他 BaseLib 遗物模组的自定义遗物自动保留,无需单独开关
[/list]

[h2]与 怪异炼化 - 遗物 共存 / Coexistence with Qurious Crafting[/h2]

可与 [b]Qurious Crafting - Relics(怪异炼化 - 遗物)[/b] 同装:本模组的替换会保留 BaseLib 自定义遗物,但 Qurious 的掉落池只保留它自己的混沌遗物,双装时实际掉落以 Qurious 为主,组合体验请以实测为准.
[i]Can be installed alongside Qurious Crafting - Relics; note that Qurious's pool replacement keeps only its own chaos relics, so with both installed drops skew toward Qurious. Test your combination.[/i]

[h2]多人联机 / Multiplayer[/h2]

遗物定义是种子与槽位的纯函数,不读取任何设置项:同种子两端生成同一批遗物.
设置项只控制本机行为(开关/替换范围),不影响生成内容.
[i]Definitions are a pure function of the run seed and slot - no config participates, so both ends regenerate identical relics.[/i]

[hr]

[h2]署名与数据来源 / Attribution[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]机制[/b]:条件与效果独立采样、种子确定性重组,来自 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3786611028]Alriph 的 Auto-Anthonyology(东尼算法)[/url] 的思想重写;本 mod 与其相互独立,不依赖也不重复其数据
[*][b]原子数据[/b]:由本模组工具从《杀戮尖塔 2》自身遗物实现中提取,经人工审计账本过滤
[*][b]生成器 / 宿主 / 渲染[/b]:本仓库独立实现
[/list]

[h2]前置依赖 / Requirements[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]必须[/b]:[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3737335127]BaseLib[/url] 3.4.5+
[/list]

[i]工坊版 BaseLib 更新经常落后于官方 GitHub;游戏更新后若 BaseLib 报错,请到 [url=https://github.com/Alchyr/BaseLib-StS2/releases]GitHub Releases[/url] 下载最新版并取消订阅工坊版.[/i]

[h2]控制台验证(可选)/ Console test[/h2]

局内按 ` 打开开发者控制台:
[code]relic add AUTOANTHONYRELICS-ANTHONY_RELIC005[/code] (添加第 6 号槽位生成遗物)"
	"changenote"		"v0.1.7: Ancient restriction affixes enter the pool - the Ancient relics' restriction-type downsides (no gold, no potions, a per-turn card-play cap, card effects stop drawing, Power cards cost 1 more, enemies gain Strength on entry) now join generation, and each is forced to appear together with the benefit the engine pairs it with, so generation never yields a relic that costs something and grants nothing; the downside appearance bonus is CANCELLED (the 140-vs-100 weight is gone, downsides draw uniformly again); pure Ancient benefits such as +1 Energy are now gated to a 5% appearance rate; two executor bugs fixed - the enemy-Strength-on-entry affix never fired in a normal fight (it was read from a trigger-only lookup that returns null for a passive affix), and the extra-turn affix's participation flag was inert and could never clear, so the guard it feeds never worked; generation seed version bumped again so existing saves regenerate fresh sets. v0.1.6: downside pool - downside fragments harvested from ALL relic sources, including Ancient and Event relics whose cards never regenerate, now enter the generation pool: curses (Greed, Curse of the Bell, Enthralled, Folly), Max-HP loss, gold loss and self-damage; downside fragments appear 40% more often than uniform sampling (weight 140 vs 100); relics with pickup effects are non-tradable per engine rules; Max HP can now only be raised under the upon-pickup trigger (mid-run max-HP growth is out of policy for generated relics); generation seed version bumped so existing saves regenerate fresh sets. v0.1.5: hotfix - obtaining a relic with a combat-scoped effect (gain energy / block / draw / apply power / damage) outside combat - e.g. an Ancient-event pickup - called the engine command with no combat context, threw NullReferenceException mid-obtain-chain and left the game's UI frozen in a render loop; combat-scoped effects are now skipped with a log line when no combat is active, and each effect runs behind a per-effect fuse so one bad effect can no longer break the whole obtain/trigger chain. v0.1.4:: lifecycle + identity - RunManager.CleanUp now resets the active seed and the definition cache when a run ends (menu/outside-run invariant); the definition cache key now includes the generator SeedVersion next to the pool fingerprint, so an algorithm or ledger change can never serve a stale same-seed pool. v0.1.3: text fix - Vigor was mistranslated as 勇气 (Courage) in the generated relic wording; the canonical game term is 活力. Workspace terminology glossary introduced so zhs terms are checked against authoritative game text instead of memory. v0.1.2:  hotfix - the merged enemy-debuff application invoked PowerCmd.Apply with 5 arguments against its 6-parameter overload (optional bool is NOT filled by MethodInfo.Invoke), throwing TargetParameterCountException inside the engine turn loop and freezing the fight (Act 4 elite/Heart report); the 6th argument is now passed and the four turn-loop hooks are exception-guarded so a relic fault degrades to a missed effect instead of a stuck combat. v0.1.1:  per-relic generated descriptions now render in-game (run-seed loc table updater; BaseLib only bakes the generic text at boot) and all 60 slots gained procedural per-slot relic icons (normal/outline/big). Also in this build: AAR-1 performance work (2026-09-15) - the relic registry lookup is now keyed by an ordinal tuple with key-coverage checks in the probe, and a frozen active-context fast path replaces the per-sweep rebuild (load-controlled A/B: 5.39/3.71/3.96 us per sweep before, 1.77/1.60/1.60 after). No behaviour change intended; the fix removes per-sweep work only."
